      "text": {
        "jp": "がははははは！　心配無用！\r\n道に迷ったら、道を作ればいい！\r\nそれが俺のやり方だ！",
        "official_en": "Ha ha ha! Nothing to worry about there. If I lose my path, I’ll just <text style=\"italic\">make</> my own path. Because that’s how I get things done!!",
        "real_en": "Gahahaha! No need to worry! If I get lost, I'll make a road! That's how I do things!"
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "CHANGE"
